4. Added a `useTRPC` hook export that components can use to access the mock TRPC context
5. Simplified the preview component to use the mock provider

This should resolve the TRPC-related error while still providing the necessary context for the component to function. The mock implementation provides basic TRPC functionality that should allow the component to render without errors.

